<title>UK: Compass says Accor sells shares at 700p/shr.</title>
<headline>Compass says Accor sells shares at 700p/shr.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>British food service provider Compass Group Plc said on Friday that France's Accor SA had sold 36.5 million Compass shares at 700p each.</p>
</text>
